  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add AddHeader and refactor response/request methods:\n      - Introduce a generic AddHeader<TKey,TValue>(ReadOnlySpan<...>) to both RequestModel and ResponseModel that inserts a header before the body (if present).\n      - The method computes key/value sizes, shifts cached body data via Cache.ShiftAt, writes key, \": \", value and CRLF, updates _body.Offset and records the header positions.\n      - Also refactor MakeHeadResponse and MakeGetResponse into expression-bodied delegations to MakeCustomResponse to reduce duplication and clarify intent. Minor performance-oriented annotations (AggressiveInlining) preserved.\n      - Replace literal '\\n' and ':' uses with shared Lf/Colon (and existing ColonSpace) constants in RequestModel and ResponseModel to standardize separators.\n      - Also stop appending _bodyLength separately and instead append the actual body data via _body.GetData(Cache) directly, merging the body output into a single builder append. This simplifies and unifies the request/response string building logic.",
